ruleText.roulette='<p>European roulette has 37 pockets: 0–36. Drag a chip to a space, or select a chip and click a space. You can place several bets at once; each settles independently.</p><p>Straight numbers pay 35:1, dozens and columns pay 2:1, and red, black, odd, even, 1–18 and 19–36 pay 1:1. Zero wins only a bet on zero and loses every outside bet. Winning stakes are returned along with profit.</p><p>Your chips remain on the board for the next spin. Use Undo or Clear to change them; auto play repeats the board as placed.</p>';
