ruleText.slots='<p>Each reel independently draws one of four equally likely symbols using the browser’s cryptographically secure random source. Three matching symbols win. The displayed multipliers include the returned stake.</p><p>777 pays 30×; ◆◆◆ pays 16×; ★★★ pays 8×; ●●● pays 4×. Each exact three-symbol match has a 1 in 64 chance. The theoretical return is 90.625% per spin.</p><p>Spins are independent. Previous results do not change the odds.</p>';
ruleText.blackjack='<p>Each round uses a freshly shuffled 52-card deck. The shuffle uses the browser’s cryptographically secure random source with unbiased range selection. Aces count as 1 or 11; face cards count as 10.</p><p>The dealer stands on all 17s. A natural blackjack pays 3:2; other wins pay 1:1. Equal totals push. Double doubles your bet, takes exactly one card, and stands. No splitting or insurance.</p><p>Auto play hits below 17 and stands on 17 or more. It does not double.</p>';
